cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "firic-rotation-counter: automated rotation counting from ROV underwater flowmeter videos"
abstract: >
  A two-stage ROI pipeline (manual coarse box + automatic flicker-based fine ROI)
  with HSV color masking and smoke-aware peak interpolation for measuring
  impeller rotation rate from ROV-captured hydrothermal-vent flowmeter videos.
  Validated against ~230 manually-counted 30-second segments across 10 dive videos
  (96.5 % rotation match, 0.0 % median relative RPM error).
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-27"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sooneeujuro/firic-rotation-counter"
url: "https://github.com/sooneeujuro/firic-rotation-counter"
